<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans SC, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>大模型只做受约束润色</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C9DBF5' }}>06 · LLM INTEGRATION</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
  <Box style={{ width: 1280, height: 581, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 300, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 660, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, height: 78, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 18, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>输入：分类 + 目标层级 + 被引用片段（不含全文）</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, height: 78, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 18, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>模板先生成结构化块，模型只润色 L1–L3 讲解</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 660, height: 78, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingLeft: 18, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3</Text></Box>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>输出清洗：越界引用编号剔除，L4 不经模型</Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ width: 480, border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', background: '#F7F9FC', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, paddingTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>三态标注，绝不伪装</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          model　｜真实模型生成<br />
          template｜未配模型，模板生成<br />
          fallback｜模型失败，自动回退
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>前端同步显示来源；`DEMO_MODE=on` 可现场一键回退演示模式。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 176, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 26, paddingRight: 26, paddingTop: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>实测证据（2026-11-16）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
        /api/health → demo_mode: false、llm_configured: true<br />
        POST /api/teaching/hint → HTTP 200 / 4.62s / <b>llm_status: "model"</b>　说明提示确实由真实模型生成
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
